OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry across the country
OL,6,Ftoday with plenty of sunny spells, and
OL,7,Fjust a few showers in Scotland.
OL,8,FLighter winds compared to recent days
OL,9,Fand feeling pleasant in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain moves into Northern
OL,12,FIreland and western Scotland tonight,
OL,13,Fbut staying dry elsewhere with clear
OL,14,Fspells. Turning chilly with a few mist
OL,15,Fpatches.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FLargely cloudy skies across
OL,18,Fthe north with some outbreaks of light
OL,19,Frain at times. Brighter in the south
OL,20,Fand feeling warm in the sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
